    )", "explanation": "The test failure is PydanticDeprecatedSince20: extra keyword arguments on Field (here `cli=`) are deprecated in Pydantic V2. Per the deprecation message and the V2 migration guide, arbitrary extras must be passed via `json_schema_extra`. Moved `cli` into a `json_schema_extra` dict; the value is unchanged."}, {"finding_ids": ["pydantic_cli/examples/simple_with_boolean_custom.py:beta_filter:deprecated-field-extra-kwargs"], "search": "        cli=("-b", "--beta-filter"),", "replace": "        json_schema_extra={"cli": ("-b", "--beta-filter")},", "explanation": "Same deprecation: the extra `cli=` kwarg on Field(...) for beta_filter is deprecated in Pydantic V2 and must be provided through `json_schema_extra`, as the deprecation warning instructs. Value unchanged."}, {"finding_ids": ["pydantic_cli/examples/simple_with_boolean_custom.py:epsilon:deprecated-field-extra-kwargs"], "search": "        cli=("--epsilon", "--disable-epsilon"),", "replace": "        json_schema_extra={"cli": ("--epsilon", "--disable-epsilon")},", "explanation": "Same deprecation: the extra `cli=` kwarg on Field(...) for epsilon is deprecated in Pydantic V2 and must go through `json_schema_extra`. Value unchanged."}], "notes": "Already correctly migrated by the previous attempt, so no change: (1) line 5 moved-import: now `from pydantic import BaseModel, ConfigDict, Field`, no ModelField/pydantic.fields import remains. (2) config-class: already uses `model_config = ConfigDict(**...)`. (3) optional-no-default for `outfile` and `gamma`: both already have `= None`. Remaining failure fixes: the `cli=` extra kwargs on Field for input_file3, beta_filter, and epsilon are now passed via `json_schema_extra`. Caveat: this assumes pydantic_cli/core.py reads the CLI flag tuple from field_info.json_schema_extra (core.py is in the migration set); if it still reads field_info.extra, it must be updated there too. I did not change input_file2, zeta_mode, or report_json, since they use no extra kwargs. The `**{k: v for k, v in vars(DefaultConfig)...}` splat in model_config was left as is because it is not one of the reported findings and I could not inspect DefaultConfig from here."}
